    "Sync Current 360° Panorama": "同步当前 360° 全景",
    "Cartographic Projection & Spherical UV Mapping": "地图投影与球面 UV 映射",
    "Equirectangular UV Texture Mapping": "等距柱状 UV 纹理映射",
    "Standard equirectangular projection maps longitude to X (0° ~ 360°) and latitude to Y (-90° ~ +90°). Perfect for fantasy world maps, planetary exploration, and sci-fi worldbuilding.": "标准等距柱状投影将经度映射到 X（0°～360°）、纬度映射到 Y（-90°～+90°），适合奇幻地图、星球探索与科幻世界构建。",
