    "Generate new photorealistic sci-fi planets, fantasy lands, and deep space nebulas from text prompts.": "使用文字描述生成写实科幻星球、奇幻大地和深空星云。",
    "Frequently Asked Questions — Map to Globe Maker": "常见问题 — 地图转星球工具",
    "Yes. 360 Panorama Viewer’s Map to Globe maker is a modern, high-performance WebGL replacement for MapToGlobe. It is 100% free, requires no login or installation, and renders instantly in your web browser.": "是。360 Panorama Viewer 提供基于 WebGL 的 MapToGlobe 替代工具，完全免费，无需登录或安装，可直接在浏览器中渲染。",
    "Can I use this for fantasy maps, tabletop RPGs, and D&D worldbuilding?": "可以用于奇幻地图、桌面 RPG 和 D&D 世界构建吗？",
    "Yes! Fantasy cartographers and novelists use this tool to project flat fictional continents created in Wonderdraft or Inkarnate onto a realistic 3D globe to test polar distortion and oceanic navigation routes.": "可以。奇幻地图设计者和小说家可将 Wonderdraft 或 Inkarnate 绘制的大陆贴到 3D 星球上，检查极地变形和海洋航线。",
    "Are my custom maps or satellite photos private?": "自定义地图或卫星照片会保密吗？",
    "Completely private. All texture mapping is executed directly on your local GPU via WebGL shaders. Your files never leave your device and are never sent to any remote server.": "所有纹理映射都通过 WebGL 在本地 GPU 上完成。文件不会离开设备，也不会发送到远程服务器。",
    "What image aspect ratio produces the most realistic globe projection?": "哪种图片宽高比最适合星球投影？",
    "Use a 2:1 equirectangular image, such as 2048×1024 or 4096×2048. Matching left and right edges help reduce visible seams; the result depends on the source image and projection.": "使用 2:1 等距柱状图片，例如 2048×1024 或 4096×2048。左右边缘相符可减少接缝，效果取决于原图与投影方式。",
    "Zoom in on globe": "放大星球",
    "Zoom out of globe": "缩小星球",
    "Rotation speed tuning": "调整旋转速度",
    "Toggle wireframe / solid material": "切换线框／实体材质",
    "Toggle fullscreen": "切换全屏",
